OL,3,GNEWSAHow a new microscope can help cure
OL,4,Abowel disease
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is hoped a new microscope will help
OL,7,Fpave the way for a greater
OL,8,Funderstanding of conditions like
OL,9,Finflammatory bowel disease.
OL,11,FThe Stimulated Emission Depletion
OL,12,F(STED) optical microscope will enable
OL,13,Fresearchers at the Rosalind Franklin
OL,14,FInstitute to study much thicker
OL,15,Fsamples, and in far greater detail.
OL,17,FThe scientists who developed the
OL,18,Fsuper-resolved fluorescence microscopy
OL,19,Ftechnology, used in the STED
OL,20,Fmicroscope, won the Nobel Prize for
OL,21,FChemistry in 2014.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
